    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571560/extras/57356bc0c8f2c58d8427ec6e5c26a826.poster.avif?t=1750965387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571560/extras/57356bc0c8f2c58d8427ec6e5c26a826.webm?t=1750965387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571560/extras/57356bc0c8f2c58d8427ec6e5c26a826.mp4?t=1750965387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The Lady Puppet is a Survival Horror Adventure game with emphasis on atmosphere and exploration. It features light puzzle solving sections, stealth sections and a peculiar &quot;doll system&quot; that lets you summon and control companions through the use of &quot;dolls&quot;.<br><br>Play as Lailah Reah, a young and innocent girl, and help her find a way out of Clawhill, a bizarre place where &quot;survivors&quot; have been turned into living marionettes.<br>Use everything you have at your disposal, survive the horror and uncover the mysteries behind Clawhill, the Masked Woman and the Final Autumn.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571560/extras/57356bc0c8f2c58d8427ec6e5c26a826.poster.avif?t=1750965387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571560/extras/57356bc0c8f2c58d8427ec6e5c26a826.webm?t=1750965387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571560/extras/57356bc0c8f2c58d8427ec6e5c26a826.mp4?t=1750965387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The Lady Puppet is a Survival Horror Adventure game with emphasis on atmosphere and exploration. It features light puzzle solving sections, stealth sections and a peculiar &quot;doll system&quot; that lets you summon and control companions through the use of &quot;dolls&quot;.<br><br>Play as Lailah Reah, a young and innocent girl, and help her find a way out of Clawhill, a bizarre place where &quot;survivors&quot; have been turned into living marionettes.<br>Use everything you have at your disposal, survive the horror and uncover the mysteries behind Clawhill, the Masked Woman and the Final Autumn.",
    "short_description": "The Lady Puppet is a Survival Horror Adventure game that puts emphasis on atmosphere and exploration. Help Lailah Reah escape from Clawhill, a bizarre world where everyone has been turned into a living puppet. Solve puzzles, use your wits to avoid the enemies and use dolls to summon companions.",
